# Close before drain: the recorded head is below an append the initiator issued
# before closing and allocated after, so the owner re-arms below it and passes it.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestCloseBeforeDrain
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the foreign author closes the hand-off marker while an issued append has not yet been allocated
PERTURBS: Close

--- FIND
    /\ hoOpen
    /\ ~fpending
    /\ \A o \in inflight : author[o] # Foreign
    /\ hoOpen' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ hoOpen
\* MUTATION: no drain before the head is recorded.
    /\ hoOpen' = FALSE
--- END
